    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Being the boss of a big company is a real challenge, but even you need a break, right?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720810/extras/fc7cbcd780ccfe732999d10485c9deec.avif?t=1755426446\" width=616 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A visual novel set in a sun-drenched resort atmosphere, filled with charming tales that weave the protagonist\u2019s fate with beautiful girls!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 140 stunning anime-style images of beautiful girls!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three unique heroines with intertwined stories waiting to be unraveled</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings based on your choices! Can you get the best ending?</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720810/extras/6ee6a888de4084899da86c39ffe9d791.avif?t=1755426446\" width=616 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re the boss of a major firm, and after years of hard work, you\u2019ve finally taken a vacation. But what\u2019s a vacation without someone special to share it with? So, you bring your loyal secretary, Beatrice. She\u2019s always been there for you, and she deserves a break too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But your idyllic resort romance is interrupted when you meet two more captivating women. Now, you face a difficult choice: remain true to Beatrice and your established relationship, or embark on a thrilling, unexplored adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720810/extras/7573b423dea5d3a24aa2e987344331c4.avif?t=1755426446\" width=616 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beatrice</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beatrice is the boss\u2019s ever-loyal secretary and indispensable right hand. She\u2019s always two steps ahead, anticipating every need. While their relationship is complex, she doesn\u2019t shy away from it. She agreed to this trip seeking fresh air and a moment of simple tranquility</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720810/extras/df6d6a4031ec144790c2983684150002.avif?t=1755426446\" width=616 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emilia</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chance encounter on this idyllic island, but sadly, she\u2019s here alone. Drawn to the boss, she seems open to spending time together. But can a meaningful relationship really blossom under the circumstances?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720810/extras/4dd48415959fe3f39162f883bc9feecd.avif?t=1755426446\" width=616 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mira</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An enigmatic beauty. Her thoughts are nearly impossible to decipher. She\u2019s disarmingly kind and open, seemingly making her an easy target for the boss. But it\u2019s hard to say who is really hunting whom.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Being the boss of a big company is a real challenge, but even you need a break, right?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720810/extras/fc7cbcd780ccfe732999d10485c9deec.avif?t=1755426446\" width=616 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A visual novel set in a sun-drenched resort atmosphere, filled with charming tales that weave the protagonist\u2019s fate with beautiful girls!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 140 stunning anime-style images of beautiful girls!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three unique heroines with intertwined stories waiting to be unraveled</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings based on your choices! Can you get the best ending?</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720810/extras/6ee6a888de4084899da86c39ffe9d791.avif?t=1755426446\" width=616 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re the boss of a major firm, and after years of hard work, you\u2019ve finally taken a vacation. But what\u2019s a vacation without someone special to share it with? So, you bring your loyal secretary, Beatrice. She\u2019s always been there for you, and she deserves a break too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But your idyllic resort romance is interrupted when you meet two more captivating women. Now, you face a difficult choice: remain true to Beatrice and your established relationship, or embark on a thrilling, unexplored adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720810/extras/7573b423dea5d3a24aa2e987344331c4.avif?t=1755426446\" width=616 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beatrice</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beatrice is the boss\u2019s ever-loyal secretary and indispensable right hand. She\u2019s always two steps ahead, anticipating every need. While their relationship is complex, she doesn\u2019t shy away from it. She agreed to this trip seeking fresh air and a moment of simple tranquility</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720810/extras/df6d6a4031ec144790c2983684150002.avif?t=1755426446\" width=616 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emilia</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chance encounter on this idyllic island, but sadly, she\u2019s here alone. Drawn to the boss, she seems open to spending time together. But can a meaningful relationship really blossom under the circumstances?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720810/extras/4dd48415959fe3f39162f883bc9feecd.avif?t=1755426446\" width=616 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mira</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An enigmatic beauty. Her thoughts are nearly impossible to decipher. She\u2019s disarmingly kind and open, seemingly making her an easy target for the boss. But it\u2019s hard to say who is really hunting whom.</p>",
